<https://lvlupcodex.github.io/medical-device-risk-ontology/ontology#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Medical Device Risk Ontology"@en .
<https://lvlupcodex.github.io/medical-device-risk-ontology/ontology#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This ontology models a European-style catalogue of medical devices, manufacturers, IMDRF risks, reported incidents and field safety corrective actions. It is designed as an application ontology for the PEC2 assignment."@en .
<https://lvlupcodex.github.io/medical-device-risk-ontology/ontology#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Medical Device Risk Ontology"@en .
